<main class="pc" data-product-core="potential"><p class="pc-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS / 03 / Potential</p><h1>Zero não é o objetivo.</h1><p class="pc-lead">O potencial é explorado individualmente, não calculado pela diferença.</p><div class="pc-steps" role="navigation" aria-label="CRANIO"><a href="../your-cranium/">01 · Personal Navigator</a><a href="../configuration/">02 · Configuration</a><a href="../potential/" aria-current="page">03 · Potential</a></div><section class="pc-section"><p>Satisfação pessoal: 0 = nenhuma, 10 = completa. Escala não clínica.</p><div class="pc-grid"><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Físico</p><h3>Movimento e conforto</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-0">Atual</label><select id="pc-current-0" data-axis="physical" data-rating="current"><option value="">— Não avaliado</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-0">Desejado</label><select id="pc-desired-0" data-axis="physical" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— Não avaliado</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">Potencial</span><div class="pc-unknown">Não determinado</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Cognitivo</p><h3>Atenção</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-1">Atual</label><select id="pc-current-1" data-axis="cognitive" data-rating="current"><option value="">— Não avaliado</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-1">Desejado</label><select id="pc-desired-1" data-axis="cognitive" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— Não avaliado</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">Potencial</span><div class="pc-unknown">Não determinado</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Emocional</p><h3>Calma e facilidade</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-2">Atual</label><select id="pc-current-2" data-axis="emotional" data-rating="current"><option value="">— Não avaliado</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-2">Desejado</label><select id="pc-desired-2" data-axis="emotional" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— Não avaliado</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span 